Subject: [PATCH] restore original frontend navigation and canonical Mii GX declaration

Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

Restore whole original SHNavigation.cpp exactly, preserving original UI, pointer
and transition decisions. Retained extracted helper headers cannot enter the
original game module. Native RFL declarations use the canonical host GX header;
the console include and all game/factory/Credits/font methods stay unchanged.

